# Only the Rust workspace goes into the API's build: its crates, path spores under
# `spores/`, and a deployment's own host crate with its git spores' clones.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!spores/
!.hypha-build/
# Built elsewhere and large: a spore crate tested on its own has its own target.
.hypha-build/**/target
spores/**/target
**/node_modules
